UPDATE places SET description_en='A memorial near Heathrow commemorates Freddie Mercury, who was born Farrokh Bulsara in Zanzibar and spent part of his youth nearby after his family moved to Britain. The location connects his global stage identity with the quieter suburban geography of his early British life.', description_it='Un memoriale vicino a Heathrow ricorda Freddie Mercury, nato Farrokh Bulsara a Zanzibar e vissuto da giovane nei dintorni dopo il trasferimento della famiglia in Gran Bretagna. Il luogo collega la sua identità scenica mondiale alla geografia suburbana dei primi anni britannici.', editorial_hook_en='Freddie Mercury Memorial: A memorial near Heathrow commemorates Freddie Mercury, who was born Farrokh Bulsara in Zanzibar and spent part of his youth nearby after his family moved to Britain.', editorial_hook_it='Freddie Mercury Memorial: Un memoriale vicino a Heathrow ricorda Freddie Mercury, nato Farrokh Bulsara a Zanzibar e vissuto da giovane nei dintorni dopo il trasferimento della famiglia in Gran Bretagna.', access_notes_en='Visible from public space; opening conditions and temporary restrictions can change.', access_notes_it='Visibile dallo spazio pubblico; condizioni di apertura e limitazioni temporanee possono cambiare.', last_verified_at='2026-10-28', updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE id='LA-265FE140' AND category='ODDITY';
